<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">2 Peetero</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebbaluwa ya Peetero Omutukuvu Eyookubiri</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peetero</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ebbaluwa ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peetero</para>
  <para style="mt2">Omutukuvu Eyookubiri</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Nze Simooni Peetero omuddu era omutume wa Yesu Kristo mpandiikira abo abaafuna okukkiriza okw’omuwendo nga ffe, mu butuukirivu bwa Katonda waffe era Omulokozi waffe Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="2PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>ekisa n’emirembe byeyongerenga mu mmwe nga mutegeera Katonda ne Yesu Mukama waffe.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuyita n’okulonda kwa Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Kubanga mu maanyi g’obwakatonda bwe, mwe twaweerwa ebintu byonna olw’obulamu buno n’okutya Katonda mu kumanya oyo eyatuyita olw’ekitiibwa kye n’obulungi bwe ye. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Ebyo bye byatuweesa ebisuubizo eby’omuwendo ebikulu, mu byo mulyoke mugabanire awamu obuzaaliranwa bw’obwakatonda, muwone okuzikirira okuva mu kwegomba okubi okw’omu nsi.<verse eid="2PE 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Noolwekyo mufubenga nnyo, okukkiriza kwammwe mukwongereko obulungi, ne ku bulungi mwongereko okutegeera, <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>ne ku kutegeera mwongereko okwefuganga, ne ku kwefuganga mwongereko obugumiikiriza, ne ku bugumiikiriza mwongereko okutya Katonda, <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>ne ku kutya Katonda mwongereko okufaayo ku booluganda abalala bonna ne ku kufaayo ku booluganda bonna abalala mwongereko okwagalananga. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Kubanga bwe muba n’ebyo ne byeyongera obungi, bibafuula ba mugaso era ababala ebibala olw’okutegeera Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Oyo atalina ebyo muzibe wa maaso era awunaawuna, era yeerabidde bwe yanaazibwako ebibi bye eby’edda.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Kale, abooluganda mweyongerenga okunywerera mu kulondebwa kwammwe ne mu kuyitibwa kwammwe. Kubanga bwe munaakolanga bwe mutyo temulyesittala n’omulundi n’ogumu. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Era mulyanirizibwa n’essanyu lingi nnyo mu bwakabaka bwa Mukama waffe era Omulokozi waffe Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Noolwekyo, ebyo nzija kubibajjukizanga buli kiseera, newaakubadde nga mubimanyi, era nga ddala munyweredde mu mazima ge mwategeera. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Era ndowooza nti kiŋŋwanira nga nkyali mu mubiri guno, okubakubirizanga nga nneeyongera okubibajjukiza. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Kubanga mmanyi nga nnaatera okuva mu mubiri guno, nga Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo bwe yantegeeza. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Kyenva nfuba ennyo okukola kyonna kye nsobola, ne bwe ndivaawo mube ng’ebyo byonna mubijjukira.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Kubanga tetwagoberera ngero bugero ezaagunjibwa wabula twabategeeza ebyo bye twalabirako ddala, eby’amaanyi n’okukomawo kwa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, era n’obukulu bwe. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Kubanga Katonda Kitaffe yamuwa ekitiibwa n’ettendo, eddoboozi bwe lyawulikika okuva mu ggulu mu kitiibwa ekingi ekimasamasa nti, “Ono ye Mwana wange omwagalwa gwe nsanyukira ennyo.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Ffe bwe twali awamu naye ku lusozi olutukuvu, twawulirira ddala eddoboozi eryo eryava mu ggulu.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Kyetuvudde tweyongera okukakasa ebyo bannabbi bye baategeeza, era bwe munaabigonderanga munaabanga mukoze bulungi. Kubanga biri ng’ettaala eyaka mu kizikiza okutuusa obudde lwe bukya, emunyeenye ey’enkya n’eryoka eyaka mu mitima gyammwe. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Okusooka mukimanye nga buli bunnabbi obuli mu byawandiikibwa, tewali ayinza kubunnyonnyola ku bubwe yekka. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Kubanga bannabbi tebaayogeranga byabwe ku bwabwe, wabula baategeezanga ebyo Katonda bye yabalagiranga nga Mwoyo Mutukuvu bwe yabibawanga.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Abayigiriza ab’Obulimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Naye waaliwo ne bannabbi ab’obulimba mu bantu, era nga bwe walibaawo abayigiriza ab’obulimba mu mmwe. Baliyingiza mu nkiso enjigiriza enkyamu etwala abantu mu kuzikirira. Balyegaana ne Mukama waffe, ne beereetako okuzikirira okw’amangu. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Abantu bangi baligoberera empisa zaabwe ez’obukaba ne bavumaganyisa ekkubo ery’amazima; <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>balibafunamu amagoba mangi nga bakozesa ebigambo eby’obulimba olw’omululu gwabwe. Abo Katonda yabasalira dda omusango era n’okuzikirizibwa kwabwe tekubuusibwabuusibwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Katonda teyasaasira bamalayika abaayonoona, wabula yabasuula mu lukonko oluwanvu olujjudde ekizikiza, gye bali, nga basibiddwa mu njegere nga balindirira olunaku olw’okusalirwako omusango. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>N’ensi ey’edda teyagisaasira, n’aleeta amataba ku nsi okuzikiriza abo abataamutya, n’alokolako Nuuwa eyabuulira obutuukirivu wamu n’abalala musanvu. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Era yasalira omusango abaali mu bibuga by’e Sodomu n’e Ggomola bwe yabazikiriza, ne bisirikka mu muliro, bw’atyo n’alaga ebyo ebigenda okutuuka ku buli atatya Katonda. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Kyokka n’awonya Lutti, omutuukirivu, eyalumwanga ennyo olw’obulamu obw’abantu abo abajeemu. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Olw’okubanga yababeerangamu, buli lunaku, yalabanga era n’awuliranga ebikolwa eby’obujeemu bye baakolanga, ekyo ne kimuleetera okunyolwa mu mwoyo gwe omutuukirivu. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Mukama amanyi okuwonya n’okuggya mu kugezesebwa abamutya, n’abonereza abatali bakkiriza okutuusa ku lunaku olw’okusalirako omusango, <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>n’okusingira ddala abo abagoberera okwegomba kwabwe okw’omubiri ne banyooma abakulembeze baabwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Tebaliiko kye batya, beerowoozaako bokka, era tebakwatibwa na nsonyi kuvuma baakitiibwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Kyokka bo bamalayika newaakubadde be basinga abayigiriza abo amaanyi n’obuyinza, bwe batwala ensonga ezo eri Mukama waffe tebakozesa lulimi luvuma. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Abantu bali bavuma ne bye batategeera, bali ng’ensolo obusolo ezitaliimu magezi ezikwatibwa okuttibwa ne zizikirizibwa; era nabo okufaanana ng’ensolo ezo, bagenda kuzikirizibwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Abantu abo bagenda kubonerezebwa olw’ebibi bye bakola. Kubanga buli lunaku bagoberera okwegomba kwabwe olw’okwesanyusa, era abantu abo bakwasa mmwe ensonyi era babaswaza bwe beegatta nammwe mu mbaga zammwe, nga bakola effujjo mu masanyu gaabwe. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Balina amaaso agajjude obukaba, tebalekaayo kukola kibi buli kiseera boonoona era basendasenda abatali banywevu, bajjudde omululu. Baana abaakolimirwa, <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>abaakyama ne bava mu kkubo okufaanana nga Balamu mutabani wa Beyoli, eyayagala empeera ey’obutali butuukirivu. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>Kyokka endogoyi etayogera, Katonda bwe yagyogeza n’emumanya olw’obujeemu bwe n’eziyiza eddalu lya nnabbi oyo.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Abantu abo nzizi ezitaliimu mazzi. Bali ng’ebire ebitwalibwa embuyaga, era baterekeddwa ekifo eky’ekizikiza ekikutte be zigizigi. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Boogera ebigambo eby’okwekuluntaza era ebitaliimu nsa. Mu kwegomba kw’omubiri ne mu bukaba bwabwe basendasenda abo abali okumpi n’okubadduka abakyatambulira mu kibi. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Babasuubiza eddembe, so nga bo bennyini baddu ba bikolwa ebibi eby’okuzikirira. Kubanga omuntu afuuka muddu w’ekyo ekimufuga. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Era abantu bwe bategeera Mukama waffe era Omulokozi waffe Yesu Kristo, ne badduka okuva mu bintu ebyo eby’ensi ebyonoona era ebitwala abantu mu kuzikirira, ate ne bava awo ne babiddamu, bibasibira ddala era obulamu bwabwe bufuuka bubi nnyo okusinga bwe bwali okusooka. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Ekyandisinze be bantu abo obutategeerera ddala kkubo lya Mukama waffe ery’obutuukirivu, eriggya abantu mu kuzikirira, okusinga lwe bamala okulitegeera, ate ne bava ku biragiro ebitukuvu bye baaweebwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Olugero olwagerebwa kyeluva lutuukirira ku bo olugamba nti, “Embwa eridde ebisesemye byayo,” na luno nti: “Embizzi eva okunaazibwa ezzeeyo okwekulukuunya mu bitosi.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Olunaku lwa Mukama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Abaagalwa, eno y’ebbaluwa eyookubiri gye mbawandiikira. Mu bbaluwa zombi ngezezzaako okubakubiriza mutegeerere ddala ebyo ebituufu era ebisaana. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Mujjukire ebyo ebyayogerwa bannabbi abatukuvu n’ekiragiro kya Mukama waffe era Omulokozi waffe ekyaweebwa abatume bammwe.<verse eid="2PE 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Ekisooka, mutegeerere ddala nga mu nnaku ez’oluvannyuma abantu abagoberera okwegomba kw’omubiri gwabwe balijja mu mmwe nga babasekerera, <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>nga bwe bagamba nti, “Eyasuubiza nti alijja, aluwa? Kubanga kasookedde bajjajjaffe bafa, ebintu byonna biri nga bwe byabanga okuva ensi lwe yatondebwa!” <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Beefuula abatamanyi nti edda Katonda yalagira bulagizi, era olw’ekigambo eggulu n’ensi ne bitondebwa. Olw’ekigambo kya Katonda ensi yatondebwa ng’eggyibwa mu mazzi era n’ebeera wakati w’amazzi. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>Era olw’ekigambo ekyo ensi eyo ey’edda, amazzi gaagisaanyaawo n’ezikirira. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Era olw’ekigambo ekyo, eggulu n’ensi ebiriwo kaakano bikuumibwa nga birindiridde okwokebwa omuliro ku lunaku olw’okusalirako omusango, n’okuzikirizibwa kw’abo abatatya Katonda.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Naye, abooluganda, temusaana, kwerabira nti mu maaso ga Mukama emyaka olukumi giri ng’olunaku olumu, era n’olunaku olumu luli ng’emyaka olukumi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">laba <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Zab 90:4</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Mukama waffe taludde kutuukiriza ekyo kye yasuubiza ng’abamu bwe balowooza. Wabula ye akyabagumiikiriza, nga tayagala muntu yenna kubula, naye bonna beenenye.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Naye olunaku lwa Mukama waffe lulijja ng’omubbi bw’ajja nga tewali n’omu amanyi; eggulu lirivaawo nga liwuuma nnyo, n’ebiririko birizikirizibwa n’omuliro, era ensi n’ebintu ebigirimu birisirikka.<verse eid="2PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Kale obanga ebintu byonna bya kuzikirizibwa, mugwanidde kubeeranga bantu ba mpisa ntukuvu era abatya Katonda, <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>nga mulindirira era nga mwegomba nnyo olunaku lwa Katonda okutuuka, olunaku obwengula bwonna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">obwengula y’ensi yonna n’ebizungirizi awamu n’ebintu ebirala byonna ebiburimu</char></note> bwe buryokebwa ne buzikirizirwa n’ebiburimu ne bisaanuuka ne bisirikka. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Naye nga Katonda bwe yatusuubiza, tulindirira obwengula obuggya n’ensi empya omuli obutuukirivu.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Kale, abaagalwa, nga bwe mulindirira ebintu ebyo okubaawo mufubenga nnyo okuba abalongoofu abataliiko kya kunenyezebwa nga mulina emirembe. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Kyokka mulowoozenga ku kubonyaabonyezebwa okw’obulokozi bwa Mukama waffe, nga ne muganda waffe omwagalwa Pawulo kye yabategeeza mu bbaluwa ze yabawandiikira mu magezi Katonda ge yamuwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Weewaawo ebbaluwa ze zirimu bingi ebizibu okutegeera, kyokka buli lw’awandiika aba ayogera ku nsonga ezo; wabula bo abatamanyi era abatali banywevu babinnyonnyola nga bwe bannyonnyola ebyawandiikibwa ebirala ne beereetako okuzikirira.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Kale, mmwe abaagalwa, ebyo nga bwe mubitegedde, mwekuume muleme kukyamizibwa abantu abo abajeemu, si kulwa nga babaleetera okugwa ne muva we munyweredde. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Mweyongere okukula mu kisa ne mu kutegeera Mukama waffe era Omulokozi waffe Yesu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18"/>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18"/>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Oyo aweebwenga ekitiibwa kaakano n’emirembe gyonna. Amiina.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
